        <mxCell id="ZQ7fNfRO3PLdDBMa6Eqq-101" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&amp;nbsp;NOTES:&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;System powered by Nucleo ST-LINK USB to ensure voltage stability.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;Common Ground established across all nodes to prevent signal floating.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;Baud Rate: 125 kbps | Protocol: CAN 2.0B.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;CAN-Bus Termination Requirement:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;120 \Omega&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;35&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;120 ohm&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;termination resistor is essential at both ends of the bus to ensure&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;impedance matching and prevent signal reflections. If your transceiver modules do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;not have a built-in termination resistor (or a jumper to enable it), please connect&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;math-inline&quot; data-math=&quot;120 \Omega&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;282&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;120 ohm&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;resistor in parallel between the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;326&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;CAN_H&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;336&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;CAN_L&lt;/b&gt; lines.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
